{"id":"n15634-2-8","stage":4,"title":"수석 · 第一名","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15634-2-8-1","ko":"올해 우리 과에 수석으로 들어온 사람이 누구인지 알아?","zh":"你知道今年我们系以第一名成绩入学的那个人是谁吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"과에","meaning":"科，系","explanation":"과：科，系；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"과","audio":"/audio/ca7de345a0a56a5e7b9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42313","senseId":"2","lemma":"과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과에","audio":"/audio/06011fa05132f667732d.mp3"}},{"text":"수석으로","meaning":"第一名","explanation":"수석：第一名；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"수석","audio":"/audio/c6df4ccc9d9d5ee02dab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15634","senseId":"2","lemma":"수석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수석으로","audio":"/audio/2bccff37ce99ade22a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"들어온","meaning":"参加，加入","explanation":"들어오다：参加，加入；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"5","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어온","audio":"/audio/5d5dd728f70348d8a023.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseI